><span begin="00:28.770" end="00:28.810"> it</span><span begin="00:28.840" end="00:28.880"> to</span><span begin="00:28.920" end="00:29.240"> yourself</span><span begin="00:29.280" end="00:30.520"> (yourself)</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.520" end="00:32.840"><span begin="00:30.520" end="00:30.860">Playing</span><span begin="00:30.900" end="00:31.070"> with</span><span begin="00:31.120" end="00:31.230"> my</span><span begin="00:31.270" end="00:31.960"> mind</span><span begin="00:32.010" end="00:32.130"> (my</span><span begin="00:32.170" end="00:32.840"> mind)</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.840" end="00:35.880"><span begin="00:32.840" end="00:33.160">Putting</span><span begin="00:33.220" end="00:33.290"> me</span><span begin="00:33.310" end="00:33.720"> through</span><span begin="00:33.820" end="00:33.970"> hell</span><span begin="00:34.250" end="00:35.750"> (hell)</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.880" end="00:39.560"><span begin="00:35.880" end="00:36.970">Ooh,</span><span begin="00:37.320" end="00:37.520"> I'll</span><span begin="00:37.560" end="00:37.710"> be</span><span begin="00:37.740" end="00:38.040"> broken</span><span begin="00:38.090" end="00:38.180"> too</span><span begin="00:38.220" end="00:39.560"> (too)</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.560" end="00:43.740"><span begin="00:39.560" end="00:39.700">If</span><span begin="00:39.720" end="00:39.810"> you</span><span begin="00:39.870" end="00:40.020"> left</span><span begin="00:40.080" end="00:40.200"> me</span><span begin="00:40.270" end="00:41.690"> like</span><span begin="00:41.720" end="00:41.830"> (me</span><span begin="00:41.840" end="00:41.970"> like)</span><span begin="00:41.990" end="00:42.100"> like</span><span begin="00:42.130" end="00:42.160"> I</span><span begin="00:42.190" end="00:42.330"> left</span><span begin="00:42.370" end="00:43.740"> you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.740" end="00:45.240"><span begin="00:43.740" end="00:44.010">That's</span><s